  "why": "Decides whether the Moonlit wheat site, its series marks, the brand kit and the seven changed stills ship as built (branch hymnapp/ftbbrand at 3015ed9ea, set manna/ftbbrand-r1). A keep on all four lets the orchestrator run kit:approve; any revise starts round 2 with a new ask showing only what changed.",
